; The prebuilt memory models are split into one library per language, and each
; binary only depends on its own: a binary using a module that refers to every
; language (such as the former Lib) links and initialises all of them (C's
; CompCert, JS's parser, ...), slowing down every start-up.
; [prebuilt] re-exports them all, for binaries that need several languages.

(library
 (name prebuilt)
 (public_name transformers.prebuilt)
 (modules prebuilt)
 (libraries prebuilt_utils prebuilt_wisl prebuilt_js prebuilt_c))
